  "notes": "どっち is the casual form of どちら.\n\nKO-SO-A-DO SERIES:\n- こっち (this way)\n- そっち (that way - near you)\n- あっち (over there)\n- どっち (which way - question)\n\nFORMALITY:\n- どっち (casual)\n- どちら (polite)\n\nNOTE: Used for choosing between two options. For more than two, use どれ.",
